name: ['Anathemancer', 'Ancient Ziggurat', 'Bloodbraid Elf', 'Cloudpost', 'Elvish Visionary', 'Gatekeeper of Malakir', 'Ghostly Prison', 'Krosan Grip', 'Qasali Pridemage', 'Rift Bolt', 'Tidehollow Sculler', 'Wild Nacatl']
